# All six cases in Russian: one table
subtitle: "Every Russian case in one table, Петербург, Москва and письмо all the way down, plus для, от, после, около and кроме with the of-ending."
tags: ["russian","russian cases","case table","russian grammar","для от после"]
teaches: ["grammar/case-tables","grammar/prepositions"]
thumb: "band \"Six cases. One table.\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Plural cases in Russian: дети, детей, детьми","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/112-russian-plural-table.cast"}

## All six cases in Russian: one table
stress: new
level: basic
shuffle: true
heading: false

